  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "bg": "white",
      "text": "Start with the map. Because the map is where the whole thing falls apart.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": 0.0,
          "scene": {
            "asset": "worldMap",
            "opts": {
              "dots": "none"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "bg": "white",
      "text": "The 2015 survey was led by an anthropologist named William Jankowiak.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": 0.0,
          "scene": {
            "img": "A02.jpg"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "bg": "white",
      "text": "It's the largest study of its kind, and romantic kissing showed up in less than half the cultures on record.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": 0.0,
          "scene": {
            "asset": "worldMap",
            "opts": {
              "dots": "split"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "bg": "field",
      "text": "And it was least common in the small foraging groups, the people living closest to how humans lived for most of our history.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": 0.0,
          "scene": {
            "img": "A04.jpg"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "bg": "white",
      "text": "That is the opposite of what you'd expect from an instinct.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": 0.0,
          "scene": {
            "asset": "scale",
            "opts": {
              "left": "INSTINCT",
              "right": "?",
              "tip": "right"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "A06",
      "bg": "field",
      "text": "Some cultures greet with the nose instead.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": 0.0,
          "scene": {
            "img": "A06.jpg"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "A07",
      "bg": "field",
      "text": "The Inuit kunik isn't a kiss. You press your nose to someone's skin, and you breathe in.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": 0.0,
          "scene": {
            "img": "A07.jpg"
          },
          "text": {
            "content": "KUNIK",
            "pos": "top"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "A08",
      "bg": "white",
      "text": "You're not tasting them. You're smelling them.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": 0.0,
          "scene": {
            "img": "A08.jpg"
          },
          "text": {
            "content": "SMELLING",
            "pos": "bottom"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "A09",
      "bg": "field",
      "text": "Other cultures press their foreheads together. Some just sniff a cheek.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": 0.0,
          "scene": {
            "img": "A09.jpg"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "A10",
      "bg": "white",
      "text": "All over the world, humans reach for each other's faces. But the mouth is not the default.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": 0.0,
          "scene": {
            "asset": "greetingRow",
            "opts": {
              "highlight": 0
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "A11",
      "bg": "white",
      "text": "It's just one option among many.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": 0.0,
          "scene": {
            "asset": "greetingRow",
            "opts": {
              "highlight": 0
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "A12",
      "bg": "white",
      "text": "So kissing looks cultural. A habit some places invented, and others simply skipped.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": 0.0,
          "scene": {
            "asset": "worldMap",
            "opts": {
              "dots": "split"
            }
          },
          "text": {
            "content": "CULTURAL?",
            "pos": "top"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "A13",
      "bg": "warm",
      "text": "A habit. Not an instinct.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": 0.0,
          "scene": {
            "asset": "scale",
            "opts": {
              "left": "HABIT",
              "right": "INSTINCT",
              "tip": "left"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "A14",
      "bg": "white",
      "text": "Except that isn't the whole picture either.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": 0.0,
          "scene": {
            "asset": "blank"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}